    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Video file supplements for \"Autonomous Vehicle Control Up to the Handling Limits for Emergency Scenarios\".\r\n\r\nVideos demonstrate three test cases as an autonomous vehicle drives around a turn near its handling limits:\r\n- No obstacle is present\r\n- An obstacle is present\r\n- An obstacle appears as the vehicle enters the turn\r\n\r\nTwo videos are available for each run:\r\n- .wmv: actual footage from similar tests. These runs do not correspond to the data presented in the paper, but present the same test scenarios and provide a general overview of the tests. \r\n- .avi: graphic depictions of the MPC plan at each control execution step as the vehicle drives through the turn. Datasets match those presented in the paper.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        }
